  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ge Wen demands year cycle powder from Immortal Hua Die and Feng Jiang, calling it his immortal material and accusing them of snatching it. Hua Die answers that Miao Ming Shen found the year cycle powder three years earlier and set a Gu formation there, which she tends every few months. After a fight interrupts the chase, Hua Die notes that Ge Wen wants to return to the Gu formation because much year cycle powder remains.",
