        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hua Die later sighs that there was so much year cycle powder, and that most of it is now in Ge Wen’s hands after the Gu formation was not hidden well enough. She needs it soon because Miao Ming Shen has already promised the material to a Gu Immortal friend for an upcoming trading convention.",
